```js
import type { VercelRequest, VercelResponse } from '@vercel/node';
```
Then, in your `serverless-function.js` file, you can require the `vercel-imports.js` file and import the `VercelRequest` and `VercelResponse` types:
```js
const { VercelRequest, VercelResponse } = require('./vercel-imports');

