Here's an example of how you can use TPdf to rotate a PDF file in Delphi 7:
```delphi
uses
  TPdf, TPdfStream;

procedure RotatePDF(const FileName, NewFileName: string; Rotation: Integer);
var
  pdf: TPdf;
  stream: TPdfStream;
begin
  pdf := TPdf.Create;
  try
    pdf.LoadFromFile(FileName);
    pdf.Rotate Rotation;
    stream := pdf.Stream;
    stream.SaveToFile(NewFileName);
  finally
    pdf.Free;
  end;
end;

procedure TForm1.Button1Click(Sender: TObject);
begin
  RotatePDF('input.pdf', 'output.pdf', 90); // Rotate 90 degrees clockwise
end;
```
